WEBVTT

00:00.970 --> 00:05.980
 ?Opening Song ?

02:03.800 --> 02:05.890
[Roars]

02:05.970 --> 02:07.640
Get out of there, Galliard!

02:12.650 --> 02:17.230
[EREN TITAN grunting]

02:19.070 --> 02:22.490
[Roars]

02:26.660 --> 02:28.200
[KOSLOW] Direct hit
on the Founding Titan!

02:28.290 --> 02:29.410
It's stopped moving!

02:29.500 --> 02:30.500
One down.

02:30.580 --> 02:33.000
Now let's put another
in the Beast.

02:33.080 --> 02:35.040
[FLOCH]
We can't let them fire!

02:36.250 --> 02:38.510
Would you piss off already?

02:40.630 --> 02:42.470
The Cart Titan is still up!

02:42.550 --> 02:44.930
We can't win this fight
unless we deal with her!

02:45.010 --> 02:46.560
[MIKASA]
Armin!

02:46.640 --> 02:48.060
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 78A groans]

02:48.140 --> 02:49.310
[MARLEYAN SOLDIERS gasp]

02:51.230 --> 02:52.850
[CONNY]
Enemy's holed up in the houses!

02:52.940 --> 02:55.520
[JEAN]
Fall back! That way's no good!

02:57.190 --> 02:59.780
Can't take out the cart till
we've dealt with those soldiers.

02:59.860 --> 03:01.150
I know.

03:01.240 --> 03:03.150
[PYXIS]
Circle around them!

03:03.240 --> 03:05.740
We'll strike the enemy
from behind!

03:10.000 --> 03:11.710
Think Pyxis has
the right idea.

03:11.790 --> 03:14.920
We don't have enough firepower
to risk a full-frontal assault.

03:15.000 --> 03:17.130
We need to attack them
from the rear.

03:28.350 --> 03:29.810
[MARLEYAN SOLDIERS scream]

03:42.360 --> 03:47.490
[ZEKE]
I fell? I'm on the ground.

03:47.570 --> 03:51.040
Did I get shot?

03:56.380 --> 03:57.880
[ZEKE]
Eren.

04:01.340 --> 04:03.260
Wake up, Porco!

04:05.010 --> 04:09.970
[REINER] We're so close.
Find your strength!

04:14.640 --> 04:16.100
[MARCEL]
I'm sorry.

04:16.190 --> 04:19.400
Listen Reiner.
The truth of it is,

04:19.480 --> 04:22.030
you were never
supposed to be chosen.

04:23.070 --> 04:24.650
[MARCEL]
I influenced the army's decision

04:24.740 --> 04:26.740
by making my little
brother look bad,

04:26.820 --> 04:28.990
and putting you
up on a pedestal.

04:30.160 --> 04:34.750
[MARCEL] Sorry. I only did it
so that he would be safe.

04:38.670 --> 04:40.500
[PIECK TITAN]
General Magath!

04:40.580 --> 04:44.090
[MAGATH]
Zeke's moving? He survived?

04:48.510 --> 04:51.720
It's time.
I'm calling the Titans.

04:51.810 --> 04:53.260
Hold on.

04:54.640 --> 04:56.520
[Gasps] Wait!

05:00.190 --> 05:01.610
[COLT]
Don't do it!

05:03.230 --> 05:04.610
Please listen.

05:04.690 --> 05:07.450
Falco accidentally got some
of the wine in his mouth.

05:07.530 --> 05:08.780
He'll turn into a Titan!

05:08.860 --> 05:10.110
Don't scream!

05:10.200 --> 05:11.620
[Gasps]

05:13.370 --> 05:15.370
What? Falco...

05:15.450 --> 05:16.580
I'm your successor.

05:16.660 --> 05:17.870
I'm inheriting the Beast Titan

05:17.960 --> 05:19.310
so I can keep
Marley from sending

05:19.530 --> 05:21.330
my whole family off
to Paradise, remember?

05:21.420 --> 05:22.410
Colt, let me go! Run.

05:22.860 --> 05:23.750
[COLT]
Even before you betrayed us,

05:23.840 --> 05:25.460
I could never figure out
what you were thinking.

05:25.840 --> 05:28.800
Maybe I don't know
the real you. But still!

05:28.880 --> 05:30.340
I never could have
imagined you as

05:30.430 --> 05:33.350
the kind of person who would
drag a child into your battles!

05:33.430 --> 05:34.760
I'm not saying this
to try and make you

05:34.850 --> 05:36.970
roll over and give up
on your plan.

05:37.060 --> 05:38.230
Just hold off.

05:38.310 --> 05:41.070
Let Falco get out of range
before you scream!

05:41.950 --> 05:43.070
You can kill whoever
you need to after that.

05:44.010 --> 05:44.900
Marleyan or Eldian.

05:44.980 --> 05:46.690
I won't try to stop you.

05:46.780 --> 05:47.900
But please!

05:47.990 --> 05:50.910
Don't turn my little brother
into a monster!

05:52.070 --> 05:54.280
Falco! We have to run!

05:54.370 --> 05:56.080
Get away, Gabi!

05:59.290 --> 06:01.120
Oh, Colt.

06:02.210 --> 06:06.380
You care deeply for your
little brother, just like I do.

06:12.930 --> 06:14.260
Don't do this.

06:14.350 --> 06:16.260
I understand.

06:18.350 --> 06:20.560
And I'm so sorry.

06:21.480 --> 06:28.480
[ZEKE TITAN screams]

06:32.070 --> 06:34.240
Run, Colt!
Run as far as you can get!

06:34.320 --> 06:36.410
Your brother's
right here with you!

06:56.100 --> 07:03.100
[ZEKE TITAN screams]

07:08.020 --> 07:09.530
What happened?

07:09.610 --> 07:13.240
They've all
been turned into Titans.

07:13.320 --> 07:16.530
Hey. Ready the
Anti-Titan rifles!

07:24.870 --> 07:29.750
[MARLEYAN SOLDIERS screaming]

07:39.470 --> 07:42.390
Falco. Take him.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.190
[Gasps]

07:45.770 --> 07:47.520
[Gasps]

07:56.320 --> 07:58.910
[GABI]
Colt? Are you...?

08:01.290 --> 08:06.290
[GABI sobs]

08:09.290 --> 08:10.800
Falco?

08:11.750 --> 08:14.630
[REINER] If I have to
keep fighting them both,

08:14.720 --> 08:16.640
Eren will break free.

08:18.050 --> 08:20.220
[REINER]
Will I have to be the one...

08:22.470 --> 08:24.850
[REINER]
...to kill Falco?

08:34.150 --> 08:35.950
Get back here!

08:36.030 --> 08:37.450
[Gasps]

08:37.530 --> 08:41.200
[REINER]
Falco. He's got my nape!

08:41.280 --> 08:42.620
[Gasps]

08:47.330 --> 08:49.130
[BOTH gasp]

08:53.550 --> 08:55.630
That shot put him down for good.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.590
Mission accomplished.

08:57.680 --> 08:59.800
We're safe,
at least for a while.

08:59.890 --> 09:03.570
[FLOCH] Dammit. Report!
Is anyone still alive?

09:04.140 --> 09:06.520
[MAGATH]
That just leaves the Founder.

09:06.600 --> 09:08.980
You've got no need
for that head.

09:09.060 --> 09:12.400
And all we need is
your spinal fluid!

09:12.480 --> 09:14.690
[Gasps]

09:14.780 --> 09:16.490
We were just a little too slow.

09:16.570 --> 09:18.110
Bring him down!

09:22.410 --> 09:26.040
You can't win now.
This battle is over!

09:35.130 --> 09:36.590
[REINER]
It's over?

09:38.090 --> 09:41.760
[REINER] Eren can't use the
power of the Founder anymore.

09:41.850 --> 09:44.140
That means our
mission is complete.

09:45.100 --> 09:50.020
[REINER] So, then, the others
can take it from here, right?

09:50.100 --> 09:54.690
I can undo the hardening
on my neck and let it happen.

10:03.370 --> 10:08.160
[REINER] I can pass the
Armored Titan on... to Falco.

10:20.340 --> 10:21.640
[Gasps]

10:24.010 --> 10:28.220
[GALLIARD] It took everything I
had left to heal even this much.

10:29.730 --> 10:33.480
But now, I can
make my death count.

10:35.360 --> 10:39.150
I finally witnessed some of
my brother's memories.

10:39.240 --> 10:41.030
You were the weakest
candidate in our unit,

10:41.110 --> 10:44.200
but he tricked the brass
into making you a Warrior.

10:45.120 --> 10:47.660
He screwed me out of it
to protect me.

10:47.740 --> 10:50.330
[REINER]
Wait. You can't!

10:50.710 --> 10:52.870
Don't do it, Porco!

10:54.130 --> 10:57.550
I can let go of
whatever doubts I still had.

10:57.630 --> 11:00.720
There's no denying
I deserved it more than you.

11:03.720 --> 11:07.010
Huh? Galliard?

11:09.720 --> 11:13.600
[REINER TITAN roars]

11:23.990 --> 11:24.740
[Gasps]

11:24.820 --> 11:25.870
[REINER]
No!

11:27.910 --> 11:30.790
That trick I stole from Pieck
worked out alright for me.

11:30.870 --> 11:33.500
I played dead long enough
to get their attention off me,

11:33.580 --> 11:36.000
and you managed to
figure it out before them.

11:36.080 --> 11:38.090
We can win this!

11:38.170 --> 11:41.550
[REINER TITAN grunts]

11:51.520 --> 11:54.730
Run! We're almost there!

12:32.930 --> 12:35.570
[ZEKE] First of all, thanks,
for agreeing to meet with me.

12:36.350 --> 12:38.860
I'm glad we're getting to talk.

12:38.940 --> 12:40.150
You spoke with Yelena,

12:40.230 --> 12:42.990
which means you know
where I stand.

12:43.070 --> 12:45.450
The Eldian euthanization plan.

12:45.530 --> 12:47.410
Do you support it or not?

12:48.320 --> 12:50.950
Four years back,
something happened

12:51.030 --> 12:54.250
to open one of our
dad's memories to me.

12:54.330 --> 12:56.040
I relived his memory
of the night

12:56.120 --> 12:59.380
he slaughtered the
royal family of the walls.

12:59.460 --> 13:01.590
He crushed their little kids.

13:01.670 --> 13:04.880
Smeared them like bugs.

13:04.970 --> 13:07.550
I felt their bodies break.

13:07.630 --> 13:09.720
If those kids had lived,

13:09.800 --> 13:12.390
the royal family would've
reclaimed the Founder.

13:12.470 --> 13:15.220
And bound to the vow
renouncing war,

13:15.310 --> 13:17.140
humanity inside of the walls

13:17.230 --> 13:19.650
would've lost any
chance of surviving.

13:19.730 --> 13:24.280
The deaths of those children
are what allowed us to live.

13:24.360 --> 13:25.900
Interesting.

13:26.990 --> 13:28.150
So does that mean
you agree with him?

13:28.240 --> 13:30.030
Think he did the right thing?

13:30.110 --> 13:32.660
No. Our old man was mistaken.

13:32.740 --> 13:33.830
[ZEKE gasps]

13:33.910 --> 13:36.080
What's more, I think
it'd be fair to say

13:36.160 --> 13:38.790
that I'm just another
mistake of his.

13:38.870 --> 13:41.920
If the Eldians in this town
had never been born,

13:42.000 --> 13:44.300
then none of them would
have to suffer and die

13:44.380 --> 13:47.920
in the plan that you and I
are about to carry out.

13:48.010 --> 13:50.430
This world was never
our birthright.

13:50.510 --> 13:53.310
It's a hell to be saved from.

13:53.390 --> 13:54.600
I'll do it, Zeke.

13:54.680 --> 13:56.140
When the moment comes,

13:56.220 --> 14:00.310
I'll bring 2,000 long years of
Titan domination to an end.

14:00.400 --> 14:03.610
Until then, we both
keep moving forward.

14:03.690 --> 14:06.110
All right? Brother?

14:09.030 --> 14:11.530
[ZEKE]
Yeah. Precisely.

14:11.610 --> 14:14.200
It's settled, then. Okay.

14:14.280 --> 14:17.200
I want nothing more than
to shake your hand, Eren.

14:17.290 --> 14:21.500
But, well, it's best if we don't
make physical contact yet.

14:21.580 --> 14:25.090
So in lieu of that,
I'll give you this.

14:25.470 --> 14:28.920
Eren. We're gonna save everyone.

14:36.180 --> 14:38.350
Let it slip past me.

14:38.430 --> 14:40.310
Guess I've gotten sluggish.

14:40.390 --> 14:43.110
All that time in the hospital.

15:45.630 --> 15:48.550
[GRISHA screams]

16:09.900 --> 16:12.070
Where am I?

16:12.150 --> 16:15.070
[ZEKE] The Coordinate,
where all Paths converge.

16:15.150 --> 16:17.070
That's my theory.

16:17.160 --> 16:19.990
When members of the royal
family inherited the Founder,

16:20.080 --> 16:22.120
and exercised its power,

16:22.200 --> 16:25.830
I think it transported them
to the plane we're on now.

16:25.920 --> 16:27.580
Hello, Brother.

16:27.670 --> 16:30.750
I've been waiting
for so long, Eren.

16:30.840 --> 16:32.630
Sitting here alone in silence.

16:32.710 --> 16:34.220
Years running together.

16:34.300 --> 16:37.220
Wondering when you were
finally going to wake up.

16:38.180 --> 16:42.560
Are you telling me that
we've been here for years?

16:42.640 --> 16:45.310
[ZEKE] That's a hard
question to answer.

16:45.390 --> 16:48.810
Everything that happens here
passes in an instant out there.

16:48.900 --> 16:50.900
Gabi blew your head clean off,

16:50.980 --> 16:52.530
but in those few moments
before your brain

16:52.610 --> 16:56.240
shut down completely,
we made contact.

16:56.320 --> 16:58.740
Our plan was a success.

16:58.820 --> 17:03.200
The power of the Founding
Titan... is in our hands.

17:07.040 --> 17:08.290
[EREN]
Someone's here.

17:08.380 --> 17:11.340
She's not a threat to us.
Don't worry.

17:11.420 --> 17:13.550
That's the Founder Ymir.

17:15.220 --> 17:17.130
That little girl is Ymir?

17:17.220 --> 17:18.390
How do you know?

17:18.470 --> 17:20.890
That's the only thing
that makes any sense.

17:20.970 --> 17:24.600
Who else would be wandering
around in a place like this?

17:25.640 --> 17:27.350
[ZEKE]
The last time I came here,

17:27.440 --> 17:30.070
she reformed my broken body from the ground

17:30.560 --> 17:32.770
and returned me to life.

17:32.860 --> 17:34.730
I suspect she's
been here for eons,

17:34.820 --> 17:37.700
sculpting Titans from the earth.

17:37.780 --> 17:42.030
Toiling away, spending years at
a time molding their bodies,

17:42.120 --> 17:44.830
anytime we called
upon their power.

17:47.500 --> 17:51.580
So she's been alone,
trapped in this empty place.

17:52.590 --> 17:56.260
[ZEKE] Eren. You must
command the Founder Ymir.

17:58.010 --> 17:59.680
At last, it's time
for us to fulfill

17:59.760 --> 18:02.550
this dream we've been pursuing.

18:02.640 --> 18:05.810
[Eren gasps] Those chains
around your neck.

18:05.890 --> 18:07.520
I was starting to wonder
if you were ever

18:07.600 --> 18:09.600
going to say
anything about that.

18:09.690 --> 18:14.320
Well, even if it took a while,
I appreciate your concern.

18:14.400 --> 18:15.860
These chains are what prevent me

18:15.940 --> 18:18.440
from using her power
as I please.

18:18.530 --> 18:21.070
They're the vow renouncing war.

18:21.160 --> 18:22.870
As I thought,
you're the only one

18:22.950 --> 18:25.330
with the ability to
move freely here,

18:25.410 --> 18:27.160
which means you're
the only one capable of

18:27.250 --> 18:29.960
taking command of
the Founder's power.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.630
Do it, and fulfill
the dream we shared.

18:34.710 --> 18:36.710
You, me, and Mister Ksaver.

18:36.800 --> 18:39.590
Please. Save our world, Eren.

18:43.680 --> 18:45.010
Eren?

18:47.430 --> 18:49.010
Activate the power
of the Founder.

18:49.550 --> 18:50.980
Do what we came here to do.

18:51.060 --> 18:52.520
Have her take away
every Eldian's

18:52.600 --> 18:55.110
ability to produce children!

18:55.190 --> 18:57.070
Once that's done,
you can use the rumbling

18:57.150 --> 18:59.320
to take out the Allied Forces.

19:00.320 --> 19:04.410
Do you seriously believe
I'd euthanize the Eldian people?

19:05.330 --> 19:06.410
Eren.

19:06.490 --> 19:08.330
What kind of person
do you take me for?

19:08.410 --> 19:11.580
I would never go along
with that repulsive plan.

19:11.670 --> 19:13.210
Sorry, Brother.

19:13.290 --> 19:15.040
I've been against you
from the start.

19:15.130 --> 19:18.380
I was just playing along
to make sure I'd get this far.

19:27.470 --> 19:29.720
[ZEKE]
This world will be a living hell

19:29.810 --> 19:32.690
as long as the Eldian
people are part of it!

19:32.770 --> 19:34.900
You have to do this now,

19:34.980 --> 19:37.650
or else the bloodshed
will never stop.

19:37.730 --> 19:39.440
This cycle of killing
we're caught up in

19:39.530 --> 19:43.280
will just keep repeating
till the end of time!

19:43.360 --> 19:46.410
So why? Why won't you end it?

19:46.490 --> 19:47.950
Tell me!

19:48.040 --> 19:50.870
'Cause I have a right to live
in the world I was born to.

19:52.620 --> 19:54.370
[EREN]
Founder Ymir.

19:54.460 --> 19:57.340
Grant me the power
to protect our people.

20:05.050 --> 20:07.510
[ZEKE]
I suspected as much, Eren.

20:07.600 --> 20:11.970
But I wanted to think that you,
of all people, would understand.

20:12.060 --> 20:15.770
Can the scars that man left on
your mind really be that deep?

20:23.400 --> 20:27.490
What's going on?
Why isn't Ymir obeying me?

20:27.570 --> 20:30.660
[ZEKE] In the years I spent
waiting for you to wake up,

20:30.740 --> 20:32.500
I learned quite a bit.

20:33.290 --> 20:36.290
I learned that the Founder
can make anything.

20:36.370 --> 20:39.880
She can even shape the earth
into these chains.

20:39.960 --> 20:43.970
But only by the will of a person
with royal blood, like me.

20:46.300 --> 20:47.720
And unlike the
Kings of the Walls

20:47.800 --> 20:49.260
who had this power before me,

20:49.350 --> 20:50.640
my mind was never tainted

20:50.720 --> 20:53.730
by the ideology
of the first King.

20:53.810 --> 20:55.770
Thanks to that,
during all the time

20:55.850 --> 20:58.690
I spent here with the Founder
waiting for you to wake up,

20:58.770 --> 21:03.490
I discovered a way to nullify
the vow renouncing war.

21:03.570 --> 21:06.900
Ymir has the power to do
almost anything you can imagine,

21:06.990 --> 21:08.780
but as a slave,
she lacks the will

21:08.860 --> 21:11.490
to exercise that
power for herself.

21:11.580 --> 21:14.120
She'll submit to anyone
who bears Eldian royal blood

21:14.200 --> 21:17.960
in their veins and obey their
orders without question.

21:18.040 --> 21:22.500
In short, the Founder's
power is mine alone.

21:22.590 --> 21:24.090
That can't be.

21:24.170 --> 21:28.010
You were no more than the key I needed to unlock that power, Eren.

21:30.020 --> 21:32.720
I waited to hear
your true feelings,

21:32.810 --> 21:34.640
and that was the right decision.

21:34.720 --> 21:36.010
[EREN gasps]

21:36.034 --> 21:38.034
This is not your fault.

21:39.100 --> 21:40.690
It was our monster
of a father who

21:40.770 --> 21:42.820
twisted you with
his brainwashing,

21:42.900 --> 21:44.990
the same as he did with me.

21:45.070 --> 21:49.910
Except, I had another father,
who saved me from that misery.

21:49.990 --> 21:51.330
It might not have come to this

21:51.410 --> 21:54.040
if you'd had somebody
to save you.

21:54.120 --> 21:56.910
I give you my word that
I won't abandon you now.

21:57.000 --> 22:00.250
I promise, I'll use the power
of the Founder to fix you!

22:00.330 --> 22:01.710
You're wasting your breath.

22:01.790 --> 22:03.670
I am going to save the world.

22:03.750 --> 22:05.920
And I'll save it with you!

22:09.880 --> 22:14.890
 ?Ending Song  ?

23:41.600 --> 23:44.690
[NARRATOR] The elder brother
refuses to abandon the younger,

23:44.770 --> 23:46.730
even after his rejection.

23:46.820 --> 23:51.820
And together, they both bear
witness to a long-hidden truth.

23:51.900 --> 23:54.950
Next episode:
"Memories of the Future."
